From: liviyifan <344781483+liviyifan@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: privsep-linux: seccomp architecture of AArch64 ILP32

The ILP32 kernel reports AUDIT_ARCH_AARCH64ILP32 (0xd00000b7) for AArch64 ILP32 tasks;
with AUDIT_ARCH_AARCH64 the privilege separation filter would kill dhcpcd's helpers there.

Signed-off-by: liviyifan <344781483+liviyifan@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/src/privsep-linux.c
+++ b/src/privsep-linux.c
@@ -192,6 +192,8 @@
 #  else
 #    define SECCOMP_AUDIT_ARCH AUDIT_ARCH_ARMEB
 #  endif
+#elif defined(__aarch64__) && defined(__ILP32__)
+#  define SECCOMP_AUDIT_ARCH 0xd00000b7U /* AUDIT_ARCH_AARCH64ILP32 */
 #elif defined(__aarch64__)
 #  define SECCOMP_AUDIT_ARCH AUDIT_ARCH_AARCH64
 #elif defined(__alpha__)
